{"agent_clan":"sase-sq","agent_clan_generation":"20260824103421","agent_family":"sase-sq.1","agent_family_role":"plan","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-sq.1","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC sase-sq[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Memory webs and strands[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]A keyed memory collection is a first-class SASE memory kind: one [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]flat web descriptor note plus a sibling directory of strand files, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]configured by users adding files, rendered as core or reference [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]memory per web, and read with `sase memory read <web>:<keyword>`. [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]The glossary, task types, and a new decision log all run on that [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]one substrate, and the config-backed glossary is gone.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]8[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]7[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]memory_webs.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Core and reference memory vocabulary[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]tiers[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]tiers: rename short-term/long-term memory to core/reference across the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Rust tier wire, note frontmatter, AGENTS.md anchors, templates, skills, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs, and prose, accepting the old spelling forever and migrating [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]existing notes in place.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Web and strand substrate[/bold #D7AFFF]                                      [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]substrate[dim] · [dim][/dim]after tiers[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]substrate: add the web/strand domain model, provider-based discovery, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the fail-closed validator, managed roster regions, and core/reference [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]web rendering behind the memory_webs beta flag.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Selector-based memory read and the web command group[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after substrate[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli: make `sase memory read`/`show` variadic over note, web, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]web:keyword selectors, add `sase memory web list|show`, and unify the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]read audit event around a note/web/strand kind discriminator.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]ACE memory pane webs and strands[/bold #D7AFFF]                              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]ace[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ace: teach the ACE memory pane to browse webs and their strands, preview[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]strand bodies, and reuse the existing memory read audit path.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Decision web and flag removal[/bold #D7AFFF]                                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]decisions[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli, ace[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]decisions: remove the memory_webs beta flag and close its flag bead, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]then ship the `decisions` core web with six authored decision records.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Generated task-type web[/bold #D7AFFF]                                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]task_types[dim] · [dim][/dim]